415
00:23:19.232 --> 00:23:20.506
Oh.

416
00:23:20.567 --> 00:23:21.705
Oh.

417
00:23:40.454 --> 00:23:41.489
Ah.

418
00:23:44.524 --> 00:23:45.696
Oh.

419
00:23:48.428 --> 00:23:49.406
